From b3f81a1b22fc67a0c6109169644ddecf2c9b67b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:14:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/88] K in the agenda shows the entry in a float again, in
 Neovim and Vim

The scenarios gave K back to Emacs's org.agenda.habits, which fails when
org-habit is off, and moved the highlighted float to gK. K is the hover
in Vim and Neovim, so it is the float again, and habits go without a key
there (the g? menu and the user's mappings still run them).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
