+* org-protocol
+:PROPERTIES:
+:CUSTOM_ID: org-protocol
+:END:
+
+86% (6 of 7)
+
+- ✅ ~org-protocol://~ URLs from bookmarklets and other programs, handed to the editor with org-lsp by ~org-lsp protocol URL~, which ~scripts/install.sh protocol~ makes the system's handler of the scheme
+- ✅ New-style (~?url=…&title=…~) and old-style (~:/URL/TITLE~) URLs, read as ~org-protocol.el~ reads them (~org-protocol-data-separator~)
+- ✅ ~store-link~: the link stored for ~C-c C-l~, with Emacs's message (~org-protocol-store-link~)
+- ✅ ~capture~: a capture with the URL's template or ~org-protocol-default-template-key~, its ~%:link~, ~%:description~, ~%i~ and ~%a~ from the page (~org-protocol-capture~)
+- ✅ ~open-source~: the file of a published page, through ~org-protocol-project-alist~ and its rewrites (~org-protocol-open-source~)
