+- ❌ Handlers of one's own (~org-protocol-protocol-alist~), which are Lisp functions
+
+Where editors fall short:
+
+- Zed ❓: The server starts a capture itself: the template is picked from Zed's question, and for its prompts the answer is typed as a rename at the cursor (~F2~), as Zed has no box of its own for typed text.
+- Helix ❓: The server starts a capture itself: the template is picked from the code actions, and for its prompts the answer is typed as a rename at the cursor (~Space r~), as Helix has no box of its own for a server to ask for text.
+
