From 3550880874f55b35a4474c6a97c3ba0768ad6c53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:08:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 49/88] The VS Code extension is published as
 kristijanhusak.org-lsp, with an icon

Its publisher is `kristijanhusak`, the Marketplace publisher, so its ID is
kristijanhusak.org-lsp (the tests ask for it); install.sh takes away the
extension of the old ID, org-lsp.org-lsp, so that the two do not both
run. The listing has an icon (the site's logo, 256 pixels), keywords, a
banner of the logo's colour, the website as home page, the issues for
bugs, and is marked as a preview. ovsx, which publishes on Open VSX,
