Zed's extension says in its description where Org's keys and tasks come
from (an extension cannot bring them), and docs/zed.org starts from the
extension installed from Zed's extensions, then the keys and tasks of
the release added. The Sublime Text package has the README Package
Control asks for and a .python-version of 3.8, as LSP's packages have.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
