+asks for them). Bugs and questions go to [[https://github.com/kristijanhusak/org-lsp/issues][org-lsp's issues]]; this package is
+written in the [[https://github.com/kristijanhusak/org-lsp/tree/main/editors/sublime/LSP-org][org-lsp repository]], and a copy of it is published for
+Package Control.
