+   "doc": "Function called to format a drawer in ODT code.\n\nThe function must accept two parameters:\n  NAME      the drawer name, like \"LOGBOOK\"\n  CONTENTS  the contents of the drawer.\n\nThe function should return the string to be exported.\n\nThe default value simply returns the value of CONTENTS.",
+   "default": "(closure\n    (hfy-user-sheet-assoc hfy-html-quote-regex hfy-html-quote-map hfy-face-to-css hfy-begin-span-handler hfy-end-span-handler archive-zip-extract nxml-auto-insert-xml-declaration-flag t)\n    (_name contents)\n  contents)",
